// expect-error: cannot use 'spawn' inside a defer body
// BUG-913. PROBE WARNING: a spawn target that touches a non-shared global is
// masked by the data-race rule, so the target here touches nothing — verified
// ACCEPTED on a pre-fix build, which is what makes this test discriminate.
void w(u32 v) { u32 t = v; }
u32 main() { defer { spawn w(1); } return 0; }
